          ["**Distress** ('bad stress')", "Negative, excessive or prolonged stress that exceeds coping capacity", "Chronic understaffing; fear of a lawsuit; abuse by attendants; a night duty after a sleepless day", "**Impairs** performance, health, judgement and relationships"],
