          ["**Respiratory**", "Tachypnoea, bronchodilatation", "Hyperventilation, aggravation of **asthma**"],
          ["**Gastrointestinal**", "Digestion inhibited, dry mouth, nausea", "**Peptic ulcer, gastritis, irritable bowel syndrome**, appetite change, obesity"],
