    "**Problem-solving skills** \u2014 define the problem, list options, evaluate, choose, act, review.",
    "**Ventilation** \u2014 talk about it; write about it (expressive writing has measurable benefit).",
    "**Humour** \u2014 a well-recognised adaptive coping mechanism (but never at a patient's expense).",
    "**Mindfulness** \u2014 non-judgemental awareness of the present moment; **Mindfulness-Based Stress Reduction (MBSR)** has strong evidence in health-care workers.",
    "**Spirituality, prayer and meditation** \u2014 significant sources of resilience for many people.",
    "**Professional help** \u2014 counselling, cognitive behavioural therapy (CBT), and psychiatric treatment when there is depression, an anxiety disorder or substance dependence. **Seeking help is a strength, not a weakness.**"
